PM下的躁动、自信与梦幻情绪。\n模拟低音、脉动琶音、打击乐合成器刺音、门限鼓组。\n快速构建，随后鼓点爆发，再渐弱收尾。\n呼吸感强烈的女性人声，节奏感强，情感克制，带有金属回声。", "Verse诗节\n我屏幕上的霓虹雨，\n梦想汇成银色。\n没有重量，只有运动，\n我沉浸在情感中。\n\nChorus合唱\n舒适的云——呼吸的光，\n代码和颜色，火花和电线。\n在数据中漫游，感受活力，\n在你的电路中，我到达了。", 999, "fixed", 97, 150, "4", "zh", "C major"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "tags"}, "name": "tags", "label": "tags", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "tags"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "bpm"}, "name": "bpm", "label": "bpm", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "bpm"}, {"widget": {"name": "duration"}, "name": "duration", "label": "duration", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "timesignature"}, "name": "timesignature", "label": "timesignature", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "timesignature"}, {"widget": {"name": "language"}, "name": "language", "label": "language", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "language"}, {"widget": {"name": "keyscale"}, "name": "keyscale", "label": "keyscale", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "keyscale"}], "flags": {}, "id": 118, "type": "TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.11.1", "widget_ue_connectable": {"duration": true, "seed": true}, "Node name for S&R": "TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["    Currently, multi-language support in ACE-Step V1 is implemented by uniformly converting all languages to English characters. At present, in ComfyUI, we haven't implemented the step of converting multiple languages into English. This is because if we need to implement the corresponding conversion, we have to add additional ComfyUI core dependencies, which may lead to unresolved dependency conflicts.\n\nSo, currently, if you need to input multi-language text, you have to convert it into English characters to complete this process manually. Then, at the beginning of the corresponding `lyrics`, input the abbreviation of the corresponding language code.\n\nFor example, use `[zh]` for Chinese, `[ja]` for Japanese, `[ko]` for Korean, and so on. For specific language input, please check the examples in the instructions. \n\nFor example, Chinese `[zh]`, Japanese `[ja]`, Korean `[ko]`, etc.\n\nExample:\n\n```\n[verse]\n\n[zh]wo3zou3guo4shen1ye4de5jie1dao4\n[zh]leng3feng1chui1luan4si1nian4de5piao4liang4wai4tao4\n[zh]ni3de5wei1xiao4xiang4xing1guang1hen3xuan4yao4\n[zh]zhao4liang4le5wo3gu1du2de5mei3fen1mei3miao3\n\n[chorus]\n\n[verse]​\n[ko]hamkke si-kkeuleo-un sesang-ui sodong-eul pihae​\n[ko]honja ogsang-eseo dalbich-ui eolyeompus-ileul balaboda​\n[ko]niga salang-eun lideum-i ganghan eum-ag gatdago malhaess-eo​\n[ko]han ta han tamada ma-eum-ui ondoga eolmana heojeonhanji ijge hae\n\n[bridge]\n[es]cantar mi anhelo por ti sin ocultar\n[es]como poesía y pintura, lleno de anhelo indescifrable\n[es]tu sombra es tan terca como el viento, inborrable\n[es]persiguiéndote en vuelo, brilla como cruzar una mar de nubes\n\n[chorus]\n[fr]que tu sois le vent qui souffle sur ma main\n[fr]un contact chaud comme la douce pluie printanière\n[fr]que tu sois le vent qui s'entoure de mon corps\n[fr]un amour profond qui ne s'éloignera jamais\n\n```\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "参照", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [530.7815551757812, 816.9539184570312], "pos": [-2571.79931640625, -1118.195068359375], "id": 120, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["# 译文\n目前，ACE-Step V1的多语言支持功能，是通过将所有语言统一转换为英文字符的方式实现的。而在ComfyUI中，我们暂未开发多语言转英文的相关功能，原因是若要实现这一转换，必须为ComfyUI新增额外的核心依赖包，这有可能引发无法解决的依赖冲突问题。\n\n因此现阶段如果需要输入多语言文本，需手动将其转换为英文字符后再进行操作。随后在对应的**歌词（lyrics）** 开头位置，输入对应语言代码的缩写标识。\n\n例如，中文标注为**[zh]**、日语标注为**[ja]**、韩语标注为**[ko]**，其余语种以此类推。具体的语言输入规范，可参考使用说明中的示例。\n\n**示例：**\n```\n[主歌]\n[zh]wo3zou3guo4shen1ye4de5jie1dao4\n[zh]leng3feng1chui1luan4si1nian4de5piao4liang4wai4tao4\n[zh]ni3de5wei1xiao4xiang4xing1guang1hen3xuan4yao4\n[zh]zhao4liang4le5wo3gu1du2de5mei3fen1mei3miao3\n\n[副歌]\n\n[主歌]\n[ko]hamkke si-kkeuleo-un sesang-ui sodong-eul pihae\n[ko]honja ogsang-eseo dalbich-ui eolyeompus-ileul balaboda\n[ko]niga salang-eun lideum-i ganghan eum-ag gatdago malhaess-eo\n[ko]han ta han tamada ma-eum-ui ondoga eolmana heojeonhanji ijge hae\n\n[桥段]\n[es]cantar mi anhelo por ti sin ocultar\n[es]como poesía y pintura, lleno de anhelo indescifrable\n[es]tu sombra es tan terca como el viento, inborrable\n[es]persiguiéndote en vuelo, brilla como cruzar una mar de nubes\n\n[副歌]\n[fr]que tu sois le vent qui souffle sur ma main\n[fr]un contact chaud comme la douce pluie printanière\n[fr]que tu sois le vent qui s'entoure de mon corps\n[fr]un amour profond qui ne s'éloignera jamais\n```\n\n### 补充说明\n1. 专业术语/标识统一译法\n- core dependencies：核心依赖包\n- dependency conflicts：依赖冲突\n- language code：语言代码\n- verse：主歌（音乐术语）\n- chorus：副歌（音乐术语）\n- bridge：桥段（音乐术语）\n2. 格式与符号保留\n- 语种缩写标识`[zh]/[ja]/[ko]`、音标标注、代码块格式均按原文保留，符合工具操作的实际使用需求；\n- 原文重复出现的语种示例说明做了简洁化处理，译文更贴合中文阅读习惯，且不丢失核心信息。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "参照", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [530.7815551757812, 816.9539184570312], "pos": [-1992.9154052734375, -1066.7752685546875], "id": 119, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [270, 314], "pos": [-962.6796875, -1316.68408203125], "widgets_values": ["da21e95fbdd27e738fe0c791148e0a6810b1328a84a6ef54f06b64d32399888b.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type"